+     * Speed Ring race (i5-12400F): with topo's two CPUs the race clock ran at
+     * 0.38 to 0.55 of real time -- the title advances its simulation on a
+     * timer its IDLE-priority timer service fires, and that thread got the
+     * guest CPUs only when nothing else wanted them -- and the race played in
+     * slow motion with the frame rate near 55. Four logical CPUs: 0.98. */
